nvocation are needed to define the user-facing interface.\",\"type\":\"free_text\",\"required\":true,\"waiver_label\":\"Command/interface not decided yet\",\"folded_from\":[\"requester:q0\",\"developer:q0\",\"developer:q1\"]},{\"id\":\"q2\",\"audience\":\"requester\",\"prompt\":\"When someone runs the command normally, what exactly should it do and show before it exits?\",\"why\":\"This sets the expected user-facing behavior, including the exact output and whether it should do anything else.\",\"type\":\"free_text\",\"required\":true,\"waiver_label\":\"Normal behavior not decided yet\",\"folded_from\":[\"requester:q1\",\"requester:q2\",\"developer:q2\"]},{\"id\":\"q3\",\"audience\":\"pm\",\"prompt\":\"How urgent is this compared with other work?\",\"why\":\"This sets delivery priority if trade-offs come up.\",\"type\":\"single_select\",\"required\":true,\"waiver_label\":\"Priority not decided yet\",\"folded_from\":[\"requester:q3\"],\"options\":[{\"value\":\"high\",\"label\":\"High priority\"},{\"value\":\"medium\",\"label\":\"Medium priority\"},{\"value\":\"low\",\"label\":\"Low priority\"}]}]}</QUESTIONS>", "time": {"start": 1784878904433, "end": 1784878907649}, "metadata": {"copilot": {"itemId": ""}}}}');
